text:
ok... take everything good from the first game (so, the whole game), then:

• make it better overall;
• add a bunch more abilities;
• add actual melee and ranged weapons;
• add equippable skills (think Hollow Knight's charms);
• add more enemies;
• add actual boss fights;
• add NPCs and sidequests
• add more suffering into the plot;

... and you've got Ori and the Will of the Wisps.
